<head>
    <title>Fruit Catcher</title>
    <style>
        body {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            background: skyblue;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        #game-container {
            position: relative;
            width: 800px;
            height: 600px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            background: #87CEEB;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        #player {
            position: absolute;
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            background: #ff6b6b;
            bottom: 200px;
            left: 50px;
            transition: left 100ms;
        }

        .fruit {
            position: absolute;
            font-size: 20px;
            color: white;
            user-select: none;
        }

        #score {
            position: absolute;
            top: 20px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: white;
        }

        .game-over {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            color: white;
            font-size: 48px;
            display: none;
        }

        #restart {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            padding: 10px 20px;
            font-size: 18px;
            background: #4CAF50;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            color: white;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div id="score">Score: 0</div>
    <div id="game-container">
        <div id="player"></div>
        <div id="game-over">
            Game Over!
            <button id="restart">Play Again</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        const player = document.getElementById('player');
        const gameContainer = document.getElementById('game-container');
        const scoreElement = document.getElementById('score');
        const gameOverElement = document.getElementById('game-over');
        const restartButton = document.getElementById('restart');

        let score = 0;
        let gameActive = true;
        let fruits = [];

        function createFruit() {
            const fruitTypes = ['apple', 'banana', 'orange', 'pineapple'];
            const fruit = document.createElement('div');
            fruit.className = 'fruit';
            fruit.type = fruitTypes[Math.floor(Math.random() * fruitTypes.length)];
            fruit.style.left = Math.random() * (gameContainer.offsetWidth - 50) + 'px';
            fruit.style.animation = `fall ${Math.random() * 3 + 2}s linear`;
            fruit.textContent = fruitTypes.indexOf(fruit.type) + 1;
            gameContainer.appendChild(fruit);

            fruit.addEventListener('animationend', () => {
                if (gameActive) {
                    if (fruit.style.display === 'none') {
                        fruits.push({
                            element: fruit,
                            x: parseFloat(fruit.style.left),
                            type: fruitTypes[fruit.textContent - 1]
                        });
                    }
                }
            });
        }

        function movePlayer(e) {
            if (gameActive) {
                const left = e.key === ArrowLeft ? 50 : 700;
                player.style.left = left + 'px';

                // Score calculation
                const fruitsCaught = fruits.filter(fruit => {
                    const playerRect = player.getBoundingClientRect();
                    const fruitRect = fruit.element.getBoundingClientRect();
                    return !playerRect.intersectionCount && 
                           Math.abs(playerRect.left - fruitRect.left) < 50 &&
                           Math.abs(playerRect.top - fruitRect.top) < 50;
                }).length;

                if (fruitsCaught > 0) {
                    score += 10 * fruitsCaught;
                    scoreElement.textContent = `Score: ${score}`;
                    fruits = fruits.filter(fruit => !fruitsCaught.includes(fruit));

                    if (fruits.length === 0) {
                        gameOver();
                    }
                }
            }
        }

        function gameOver() {
            gameActive = false;
            gameOverElement.style.display = 'block';
            player.style.left = '50px';
        }

        function resetGame() {
            gameOverElement.style.display = 'none';
            score = 0;
            scoreElement.textContent = `Score: ${score}`;
            gameActive = true;
            fruits = [];
        }

        // Event listeners
        document.addEventListener('keydown', movePlayer);
        document.addEventListener('keypress', movePlayer);
        restartButton.addEventListener('click', resetGame);

        // Game loop
        setInterval(() => {
            if (gameActive) {
                createFruit();
            }
        }, 2000);
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

This game includes the following features:

1. A red player character that can move left and right using arrow keys
2. Randomly falling fruits (apple, banana, orange, and pineapple)
3. Simple collision detection
4. Score tracking
5. Game over when the player goes too far down
6. A restart button
7. Smooth animations for the falling fruits

How to play:
1. Use the left and right arrow keys to move the red player
2. Catch the falling fruits by moving your character under them
3. Each fruit caught increases your score by 10 points
4. Try to catch as many fruits as possible
5. If you fall too far, the game ends
6. Click "Play Again" to restart

